---
source: system/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"ipcmk\")"
---
Create System V IPC resources.

Creates shared memory segments, message queues, or semaphore arrays using shmget(2), msgget(2), or
semget(2) with IPC_PRIVATE.

Usage: ipcmk [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -M, --shmem <SHMEM>
          Create shared memory segment of given size in bytes

  -Q, --queue
          Create message queue

  -S, --semaphore <SEMAPHORE>
          Create semaphore array with N elements

  -p, --mode <MODE>
          Permissions in octal (default: 0644)
          
          [default: 0644]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
